# This is the configuration file for Burrow.
#
# This template file has been automatically created at the following
# path since Burrow couldn't find any existing config files on your system:
#
#   {[path]s}
#
# Burrow is built on Ghostty and supports all of Ghostty's configuration
# options, with sensible defaults for all of them, so this template doesn't
# set anything. Only set the options you actually need.
#
# Burrow keeps its own configuration: it does not read Ghostty's config
# files. To reuse your Ghostty settings, copy the options you want here, or
# include Ghostty's file with a line like:
#
#   config-file = ?~/.config/ghostty/config.ghostty
#
# Every option is documented at https://ghostty.org/docs/config. To list all
# options and their defaults from the command line, run:
#
#   /Applications/Burrow.app/Contents/MacOS/ghostty +show-config --default --docs
#
# (adjust the path to wherever Burrow.app is). Burrow can reload this file
# while running from the menu or with Command + Shift + comma. Not all options
# can be reloaded while running; some only apply to new windows and others
# need a full restart.

